{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000556","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000556"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000556","label":"湣王（尉繚引述）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"湣王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-006-shihuang:m011-0102"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m011-0102","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p011","quote":"湣王"}],"identity_note":"依本卷特定時代與事件暫定人物；不以同稱、官號或短名全域合併，未見本名不補造。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m011-0102","start":102,"end":104,"surface":"湣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000556","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p011","text":"大索，逐客，李斯上書說，乃止逐客令。李斯因說秦王，請先取韓以恐他國，於是使斯下韓。韓王患之。與韓非謀弱秦。大梁人尉繚來，說秦王曰：「以秦之彊，諸侯譬如郡縣之君，臣但恐諸侯合從，翕而出不意，此乃智伯、夫差、湣王之所以亡也。願大王毋愛財物，賂其豪臣，以亂其謀，不過亡三十萬金，則諸侯可盡。」秦王從其計，見尉繚亢禮，衣服食飲與繚同。繚曰：「秦王為人，蜂準，長目，摯鳥膺，豺聲，少恩而虎狼心，居約易出人下，得志亦輕食人。我布衣，然見我常身自下我。誠使秦王得志於天下，天下皆為虜矣。不可與久游。」乃亡去。秦王覺，固止，以為秦國尉，卒用其計策。而李斯用事。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m011-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"李斯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000537","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m011-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"李斯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000537","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m011-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"秦王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官稱或句讀疑問待核；不補造姓名或直接同稱合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m011-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"斯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000537","status":"context